    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/d635a8f1107a2493a6a46b4883a921db.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=323 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a whimsically dark journey to rescue your dearest friend, the Blacksmith.</strong> <br>In <i>Across Unbeaten Paths</i>, you\u2019ll brave a mysterious land, face eerie foes, and manage your items in creative ways\u2014all to bring back home someone you care about.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/54f37806c48a757bfbcf2fd43c5e3bcb.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grid shape-fitting system commonly used for inventories in other games becomes a core feature here, but with a twist\u2014 <strong>it <i>is</i> the battlefield</strong>.<br><br><i>Across Unbeaten Paths</i> combines the variability of rogue-like deck builders with the spatial strategy of inventory management systems. <br> <br>All cards have only one condition to be played\u2014\u00a0<strong>do they fit on the field? </strong>But you'll still need to think carefully about where, how and what you place.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/610c949103441d512111d828206a88c5.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/610c949103441d512111d828206a88c5.webm?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/610c949103441d512111d828206a88c5.mp4?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/b761e96d53e9c4bfbd521312414625a0.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each battle is a different puzzle.</strong><br>Solve problems with what you\u2019ve got.  Adapt, strategize, and make smart use of each draw to get as far as you can. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/83f6e8a9aa20fe6279905f02577ff9e6.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards can have unique effects\u2014stack them, chain them, and create satisfying combos.   But also be aware of your enemy's cards, they can influence your items as well. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/b63537695d04594cd40e52562afe1cb5.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/b63537695d04594cd40e52562afe1cb5.webm?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/b63537695d04594cd40e52562afe1cb5.mp4?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/73d17f199fd995955947f6d1050e544d.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from <strong>five tiny critters</strong>, each with distinct personalities, cards, skills, and storylines.  <br>Every character offers an unique playstyle and brings something new to your adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   The Rabbit Knight - Fill the field with as many weapons and armor as possible;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mouse Rogue - Steal, hide and cheat your way to victory;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fox Ranger - Master the environment and use the field itself to your advantage;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Owl Wizard - Chain your magic together to empower your attacks;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beaver Smith - Combine materials to craft your items mid battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/2239a8ab7587ebafef77b7e8f9bb413b.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/2239a8ab7587ebafef77b7e8f9bb413b.webm?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/485c904bdd6d68945e5007fdd64df0ea.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse cast of strange creatures\u2014some will challenge you with their own decks and tactics, others will help you on your journey.  <br>The forest is full of perils... but you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/786e61655188c0e8d7fe76102c64e19e.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/786e61655188c0e8d7fe76102c64e19e.webm?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/37957d97cba0baa7365093e6f3fcd56c.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress. Die. Learn. Adapt.<br>Unlock new cards, skills, characters and paths with each run\u2014building a stronger strategy with every try.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/d1311ef67a332cfecd68ea86f0f09e6b.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/d1311ef67a332cfecd68ea86f0f09e6b.webm?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/e370040815329c8727e4446b56a85b7f.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, find, craft, enchant, and fine-tune your deck to match how <i>you</i> want to play.<br>Build your own personalized card arsenal in each run. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/21c6212d95ded717465668c4abd4ea0f.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/21c6212d95ded717465668c4abd4ea0f.webm?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/76f9f672a983b20d4bee6bad0a545705.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, I'm <strong>ExEz!</strong> I'm not a developer, artist or have ever worked with games before. <strong> </strong>Just someone who love games.<br><br>And I\u2019m making this game by myself\u2014from code and hand drawn art to writing and game design (with help from a few talented folks for sounds and some assets).  <br>This is a passion project of mine\u2014and if you wish to support it, you\u2019ll be directly helping that dream come to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(There's absolutely no AI involved in this project)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free demo is coming soon</strong>, and I\u2019d love for you to give it a shot.<br><br> Follow me on my socials if you'd like to know more, or just ask!<br>Thanks for reading\u2014and for crossing these unbeaten paths with me. \u2764\ufe0f Obrigado!</p>",
