character offers an unique playstyle and brings something new to your adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   The Rabbit Knight - Fill the field with as many weapons and armor as possible;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mouse Rogue - Steal, hide and cheat your way to victory;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fox Ranger - Master the environment and use the field itself to your advantage;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Owl Wizard - Chain your magic together to empower your attacks;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beaver Smith - Combine materials to craft your items mid battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/2239a8ab7587ebafef77b7e8f9bb413b.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/2239a8ab7587ebafef77b7e8f9bb413b.webm?t=1748094347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/485c904bdd6d68945e5007fdd64df0ea.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a diverse cast of strange creatures\u2014some will challenge you with their own decks and tactics, others will help you on your journey.  <br>The forest is full of perils... but you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/786e61655188c0e8d7fe76102c64e19e.poster.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat