ass=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669100/extras/76f9f672a983b20d4bee6bad0a545705.avif?t=1748094347\" width=616 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, I'm <strong>ExEz!</strong> I'm not a developer, artist or have ever worked with games before. <strong> </strong>Just someone who love games.<br><br>And I\u2019m making this game by myself\u2014from code and hand drawn art to writing and game design (with help from a few talented folks for sounds and some assets).  <br>This is a passion project of mine\u2014and if you wish to support it, you\u2019ll be directly helping that dream come to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(There's absolutely no AI involved in this project)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free demo is coming soon</strong>, and I\u2019d love for you to give it a shot.<br><br> Follow me on my socials if you'd like to know more, or just ask!<br>Thanks for reading\u2014and for crossing these unbeaten paths with me. \u2764\ufe0f Obrigado!</p>",
